Z||000000||reddog||12-21-2001||08:06 PM||||Finally got some pics of the 86 GT that I bought a couple of weeks ago. It is a pretty good  car mechanically but I don't care for some of the things that the previous owner did to it! He cut out the front fascia and put holes in the hood. He tried to cut holes in the sale panel but ended up cracking the glass or whatever it is. It looks like total crap. Then he bought some of the cheap JC Whitney scoop and glued them on each side of the car in front of the rear wheels( where the intake is ). needless to say I will be busy for quite a while getting this car up to par with the yellow one!!    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/newGTmix.jpg">   <P>Notice all the leaves??? You should have seen it before I washed it 3 times!!! I'm taking it Thursday to have it detailed!!!<P>------------------<BR>         <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Picturenew_sig.jpg">   <P>[This message has been edited by reddog (edited 12-21-2001).]<p>[This message has been edited by reddog (edited 12-21-2001).]||||reg||1
