Z||000003||8Ball||12-21-2001||10:20 PM||||I am not sure what is wrong with it atm.<BR>As you may remember the engine is slowly dieing. The head gasket is leaking. So are the valve gaskets. Every seal in it is shot and when I bought it, the oil was sludge and the tranny fluid was thin as water.<P>But as for what is wrong now, Well starting on monday it got harder and harder to start. Then on wensday it kept dieing when I would hit the gas. Then thursday morning it would no longer start. It will crank and crank, but will not turn over. I know it is getting gas. And the rotor, button, plugs and wires are all new. The ecm is not throwing any codes. So basically I have not a clue what is wrong.<P>Randy||||reg||1
